.gemini/
examples/distributed_history/specs/generated

# EA-DF-10: an eval fixture that IS a home must be tracked. `.skill-manager/`
# above matches at any depth, so a fixture home is invisible to git and to
# `git archive`, which is what builds the eval view -- the case would ship with
# no fixture and nobody would be told. Negate the directory itself, not just its
# contents: git cannot re-include a file whose parent directory is excluded.
!evals/**/fixture/.skill-manager/
!evals/**/fixture/.skill-manager/**
